{
 "hook-1": {
  "start": 0,
  "duration": 379,
  "audioFrames": 359,
  "audioSec": 11.967,
  "chapter": "hook",
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "gap": 0.28,
  "scale": 1,
  "provisional": false,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "大促时，你在搜索结果里看到一件衣服，标着一个到手价。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 4.953
   },
   {
    "text": "加购去结算，价格反而更低，红包抵扣这时才算上。",
    "start": 5.233,
    "dur": 4.728
   },
   {
    "text": "这是出 bug 了吗？",
    "start": 10.241,
    "dur": 1.73
   }
  ]
 },
 "hook-2": {
  "start": 379,
  "duration": 211,
  "audioFrames": 201,
  "audioSec": 6.7,
  "chapter": "hook",
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 368,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "gap": 0.28,
  "scale": 1,
  "provisional": false,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "其实不是，是网站故意这么做的。",
    "start": -0.016,
    "dur": 3.212
   },
   {
    "text": "我们先看看，要是不这么做，会发生什么。",
    "start": 3.476,
    "dur": 3.237
   }
  ]
 },
 "avalanche-1": {
  "start": 590,
  "duration": 213,
  "audioFrames": 205,
  "audioSec": 6.833,
  "chapter": "avalanche",
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "gap": 0.28,
  "scale": 1,
  "provisional": false,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "算一个到手价，后台要同时去找商品价格、优惠券和红包几个服务，全回来才能算。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 6.823
   }
  ]
 },
 "avalanche-2": {
  "start": 803,
  "duration": 595,
  "audioFrames": 559,
  "audioSec": 18.633,
  "chapter": "avalanche",
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 213,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "gap": 0.28,
  "scale": 1,
  "provisional": false,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "大促时红包服务卡住了，到手价计算就一直等着它，请求越积越多，计算服务也被拖垮，连购物车和结算页的价格都算不出来。",
    "start": 0.003,
    "dur": 11.736
   },
   {
    "text": "一个服务出问题，一层层往上传，最后整个网站都崩了，这就叫雪崩。",
    "start": 12.019,
    "dur": 6.626
   }
  ]
 },
 "breaker-1": {
  "start": 1398,
  "duration": 269,
  "audioFrames": 261,
  "audioSec": 8.7,
  "chapter": "breaker",
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "gap": 0.28,
  "scale": 1,
  "provisional": false,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "想想家里的电闸。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 1.684
   },
   {
    "text": "某个电器短路了，那一路的空气开关「啪」地跳下来，只断这一路，冰箱和灯照常用。",
    "start": 1.964,
    "dur": 6.723
   }
  ]
 },
 "breaker-2": {
  "start": 1667,
  "duration": 337,
  "audioFrames": 316,
  "audioSec": 10.533,
  "chapter": "breaker",
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 269,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "gap": 0.28,
  "scale": 1,
  "provisional": false,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "网站也装了这样的开关：发现红包服务老是出错，就先跳闸，不再去调用它，到手价计算也不再等它。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 8.543
   },
   {
    "text": "这就叫熔断。",
    "start": 8.823,
    "dur": 1.71
   }
  ]
 },
 "half-open-1": {
  "start": 2004,
  "duration": 266,
  "audioFrames": 239,
  "audioSec": 7.967,
  "chapter": "half-open",
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "gap": 0.28,
  "scale": 1,
  "provisional": false,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "跳闸以后，也不能一直断着。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 2.293
   },
   {
    "text": "过一会儿，网站会先放一个请求过去试一试，这个状态叫半开。",
    "start": 2.573,
    "dur": 5.396
   }
  ]
 },
 "half-open-2": {
  "start": 2270,
  "duration": 403,
  "audioFrames": 385,
  "audioSec": 12.833,
  "chapter": "half-open",
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 247,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "gap": 0.28,
  "scale": 1,
  "provisional": false,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "试成功了，说明红包服务好了，就合上闸恢复调用；还是失败，就继续断开，过一阵再试。",
    "start": 0.016,
    "dur": 7.435
   },
   {
    "text": "另外每次调用都设个等待上限，叫超时，绝不死等。",
    "start": 7.731,
    "dur": 5.086
   }
  ]
 },
 "degrade-1": {
  "start": 2673,
  "duration": 333,
  "audioFrames": 306,
  "audioSec": 10.2,
  "chapter": "degrade",
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "gap": 0.28,
  "scale": 1,
  "provisional": false,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "断开以后，价格还得算出来。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 2.107
   },
   {
    "text": "系统先不把红包算进去，照样给出到手价，红包本身没被用掉，这叫自动降级。",
    "start": 2.387,
    "dur": 7.808
   }
  ]
 },
 "degrade-2": {
  "start": 3006,
  "duration": 507,
  "audioFrames": 479,
  "audioSec": 15.967,
  "chapter": "degrade",
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 314,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "gap": 0.28,
  "scale": 1,
  "provisional": false,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "还有一种是提前动手，就像用电紧张时先关空调、保冰箱。",
    "start": 0.008,
    "dur": 5.359
   },
   {
    "text": "大促时，购物车和结算页是冰箱，搜索推荐页里的红包计算是空调，先关掉它，把资源留给结算。",
    "start": 5.647,
    "dur": 8.561
   },
   {
    "text": "这叫主动降级。",
    "start": 14.488,
    "dur": 1.471
   }
  ]
 },
 "recap-1": {
  "start": 3513,
  "duration": 571,
  "audioFrames": 563,
  "audioSec": 18.767,
  "chapter": "recap",
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "gap": 0.28,
  "scale": 1,
  "provisional": false,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "简单说，熔断负责及时断开，降级负责找替代办法，保住最要紧的价格计算。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 7.23
   },
   {
    "text": "扛住高峰四招：消息队列让订单排队不丢，限流守住门口，幂等保证只扣一次钱，熔断降级防止一个服务挂了，整个网站都崩。",
    "start": 7.51,
    "dur": 11.241
   }
  ]
 },
 "recap-2": {
  "start": 4084,
